      <activity id="7017350c-4f77-515c-a1f6-1acff188d0e4" activityNameId="53b8f5a9-ed19-5716-be3e-30d1d54a3e4e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, high voltage, production from photovoltaic DE, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, high voltage, production from photovoltaic DE, at grid
This dataset describes the transmission of high voltage electricity.;
UUID: 431337c2-4aa4-37d3-b1c6-4118fa5f67c0
Included are the electricity production in Italy, the transmission network and direct emissions to air (ozone and N2O). Electricity losses are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Ozone- and NO2-emission factors are based on published measurements made in various countries.  Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on Swiss data.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: total electricity in Switzerland: 37 TWh
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_431337c2-4aa4-37d3-b1c6-4118fa5f67c0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
